{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00420",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.53,
      "end_seconds": 1.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Hello, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.0,
      "end_seconds": 8.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Well, thanks, doctor. It's been a long few days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 9.78,
      "end_seconds": 14.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "So, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.96,
      "end_seconds": 19.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome. Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.85,
      "end_seconds": 24.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.2,
      "end_seconds": 26.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "So, what's been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.41,
      "end_seconds": 47.41,
      "duration_seconds": 19.0,
      "text": "So, So the thing is, I've got a mole on my back that looks different. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.92,
      "end_seconds": 50.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "So, how long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.55,
      "end_seconds": 56.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Hmm, you know, I've had it since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.15,
      "end_seconds": 59.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.77,
      "end_seconds": 76.46,
      "duration_seconds": 15.69,
      "text": "Okay, so when it starts I tend to get it bled once as well. Oh, the it bled once? That's been for five days. Another new spot on my arm was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.43,
      "end_seconds": 81.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.35,
      "end_seconds": 85.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Oh, no problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.45,
      "end_seconds": 88.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Any weight loss, history of sunburn, pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.33,
      "end_seconds": 91.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.39,
      "end_seconds": 98.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any lumps in the armpit or history of skin cancer?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.65,
      "end_seconds": 105.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Right, you know, no, no lumps in the armpit or history of skin cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.26,
      "end_seconds": 110.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.94,
      "end_seconds": 115.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Oh, you know, no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.15,
      "end_seconds": 117.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.73,
      "end_seconds": 123.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Well, yes, I had my gallbladder removed, in 2016."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.71,
      "end_seconds": 129.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Alright, do you have any known allergies at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.29,
      "end_seconds": 135.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "No, um, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.02,
      "end_seconds": 138.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me just write this down properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.26,
      "end_seconds": 161.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.0,
      "end_seconds": 167.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Hmm, I'm on clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 171.54,
      "end_seconds": 181.11,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Uh, doctor, I think the last prescription for the clopidogrel was 150 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.71,
      "end_seconds": 185.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.86,
      "end_seconds": 192.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Oh, no, I left it at home. It's hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.81,
      "end_seconds": 195.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.96,
      "end_seconds": 197.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "For two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.08,
      "end_seconds": 200.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.11,
      "end_seconds": 206.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.17,
      "end_seconds": 208.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.82,
      "end_seconds": 212.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.14,
      "end_seconds": 215.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.91,
      "end_seconds": 220.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Heart disease, for two years. I have eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.26,
      "end_seconds": 223.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.68,
      "end_seconds": 234.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.86,
      "end_seconds": 255.82,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 82 beats a minute, saturation 98 percent, blood pressure 125 over 75, temp 36.7 degrees. Alright, do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.34,
      "end_seconds": 274.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.85,
      "text": "Yes, you know, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.96,
      "end_seconds": 278.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.44,
      "end_seconds": 280.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.11,
      "end_seconds": 283.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.01,
      "end_seconds": 306.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "It's about eight millimetres, with an uneven border and two shades of brown."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.58,
      "end_seconds": 309.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.18,
      "end_seconds": 326.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I can't feel any glands in the armpit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.75,
      "end_seconds": 348.4,
      "duration_seconds": 19.65,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with a pigmented lesion that needs to be looked at more closely. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. It could also be a seborrhoeic keratosis, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.51,
      "end_seconds": 359.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.64,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a mole on your back that looks different, since Monday, and no fever or history of skin cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.54,
      "end_seconds": 362.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Yes, um, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.77,
      "end_seconds": 365.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 367.19,
      "end_seconds": 368.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 369.55,
      "end_seconds": 394.35,
      "duration_seconds": 24.8,
      "text": "Let's get a dermoscopy, for changing mole. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Let's get a skin biopsy, for changing mole. Please use sunscreen and cover up in the midday sun, and check your skin once a month. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. We'll refer you to a dermatologist."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.1,
      "end_seconds": 401.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 402.51,
      "end_seconds": 404.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 405.66,
      "end_seconds": 414.77,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse. I'd like to see you again after the biopsy results."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 416.09,
      "end_seconds": 419.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Okay, uh, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.6,
      "end_seconds": 427.41,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 430.6,
      "end_seconds": 436.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "So, you know, I come back after the biopsy results. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 437.59,
      "end_seconds": 443.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.62,
      "end_seconds": 448.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Yeah, no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 449.14,
      "end_seconds": 449.86,
      "duration_seconds": 0.72,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}